      "text": "A place in America where residents need not worry about locking their doors at night.\nOr even when they leave their home to go to the store. (and no cameras needed either).\nI too live in such a place a few hours south of Mackinac Island in Ohio. \nAn area of the US most of the country forgets about. And that is just fine by me.",
